{"slug":"cleveland-browns-fans-are-out-of-pockets-twitter-user-calls-to-cancel-the-franchise","postId":75081,"title":"Cleveland Browns Fans Are Out Of Pocket & Twitter User Calls To Cancel The Franchise","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":518614,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/https___dawgpounddaily.com_wp-content_uploads_imagn-images_2018_08_15337452-1024x736.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-518614\"/><figcaption>USA Today</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Cleveland Browns are playing the New York Jets today [Sunday], and at the start of the fourth quarter, it is 17-17. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jacoby Brissett has thrown for 187 yards on 18 of 22 completions and a touchdown. Seven of those 18 passes from Brissett have gone to Amari Cooper for 85 yards and a touchdown, and Cooper is averaging 12.1 yards per catch. Nick Chibb has rushed for 37 yards on 11 carries and averaging 3.4 yards per carry. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before the game though Browns fans where tailgating and apparently they set up a doll with the sign happy ending are not illegal. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even worse, a flag was hanging on top of the tailgate. He showed Watson's face on an <a href=\"https://www.vice.com/en/article/wxeywy/the-untold-story-of-wood-the-well-endowed-man-from-those-coronavirus-texts\">explicit meme </a>that's went viral over the last few years. A female hand is across his left shoulder.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/brandonleuschel/status/1571530270721077248?s=20u0026t=Jyq4SdVB18a8OlO2LQ8NAA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/brandonleuschel/status/1571530270721077248?s=20&amp;t=Jyq4SdVB18a8OlO2LQ8NAA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/brandonleuschel/status/1571531715411316738?s=20u0026t=0xWDxgralq68t70RpHmxzA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/brandonleuschel/status/1571531715411316738?s=20&amp;t=0xWDxgralq68t70RpHmxzA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Clearly, they are referencing Deshaun Watson's current off the field issues. Watson, in August, was suspended 11 games and fined $5 million because of allegations of sexual misconduct against him by more than two dozen women.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During the preseason season, Cleveland fans showed up at the games with disgusting signs while off-brand, <a href=\"https://www.audacy.com/937thefan/sports/disgusting-behavior-from-some-browns-fans-defending-watson\">horribly inappropriate T-shirts</a> were sold outside the stadium.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/aliciadawnnnnn/status/1561411150012682240?s=20u0026t=lq8-32RGDmkQZuXXu2qycA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/aliciadawnnnnn/status/1561411150012682240?s=20&amp;t=lq8-32RGDmkQZuXXu2qycA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->","excerpt":"USA Today The Cleveland Browns are playing the New York Jets today [Sunday], and at the start of the fourth quarter, it is 17-17. Jacoby Brissett has thrown for 187 yards on 18 of 22 completions and…","publishedAt":"2022-09-18T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-09-18T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"cleveland-browns","name":"Cleveland Browns"},{"slug":"jacoby-brissett","name":"Jacoby Brissett"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"nick-chibbs","name":"Nick Chibbs"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/https___dawgpounddaily.com_wp-content_uploads_imagn-images_2018_08_15337452-1024x736.jpeg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/https___dawgpounddaily.com_wp-content_uploads_imagn-images_2018_08_15337452-1024x736.jpeg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/cleveland-browns-fans-are-out-of-pockets-twitter-user-calls-to-cancel-the-franchise/"}